<p>Flat-pack furniture is built to fit an average room. A built-in is built to fit yours: the alcove beside the fireplace, the space under the stairs, the corner nothing else will fit. We design and build custom shelving, window seats, closets, vanities and storage walls on site, measured to the wall and scribed to the floor. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured carpentry business in Carleton Place since 2020.</p>

